0,Barambu people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barambu_people,"The Barambu (or Barambo) are an ethnic group who live in the northeast of the Democratic Republic of the Congo. The Joshua Project as of 2020 gave the population as 61,000 located in the Poko territory of Bas-Uélé province, between the Bomokandi and Uélé rivers.",Barambu,Niger-Congo
